M, convert each operand to its unsigned two's-complement\nmagnitude; DIVU and REMU use the original unsigned operands. Precompute\nzero-extended divisor multiples D, 2D, and 3D in 34 bits so overflow is\nimpossible. Unroll sixteen stages, consuming dividend bit pairs from\nmost significant to least significant. Each stage forms the 34-bit trial\nremainder T = (R << 2) | next_pair and computes T-D, T-2D, and T-3D\nin parallel as 35-bit zero-extended subtractions. Their high borrow bits\nselect the largest nonnegative subtraction and hence quotient digit\n0, 1, 2, or 3. Reuse each subtraction's result for the selected remainder\nrather than placing a second subtractor after the digit selection.\nFor nonzero D, the selected remainder is less than D and fits in 32 bits.\nAssemble the quotient from the sixteen digits\n…[4779 of 7851 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:979cae2d53924a74]…\nthem, then compare median\nGowin Fmax times iterations/cycle against the 95.23 champion. Accept\nonly a measured improvement exceeding the 4.6 percent margin.\n\nNotes: \n{\"id\": \"hyp-20261005-002-r2s1\", \"category\": \"structural\", \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 107.09, \"fmax_mhz\": 51.943, \"cycles\": 4850577, \"lut4\": 2684, \"ff\": 780, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -14.679, \"arrival_ns\": 24.973, \"logic_cells\": 14, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}}\n{\"id\": \"hyp-20261005-003-r2s2\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 109.55, \"fmax_mhz\": 45.983, \"cycles\": 4197447, \"lut4\": 3059, \"ff\": 966, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.direct_target_match_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -16.328, \"arrival_ns\": 26.622, \"logic_cells\": 74, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_id/u