{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_34","type":"agent_message","text":"The mux rewrites tested so far haven’t improved timing. Gowin’s report shows the ID/EX operand registers being absorbed into register-file BRAM outputs, leaving a long path through forwarding and multiplication. I’m checking whether explicit flip-flop register storage preserves that pipeline boundary and raises Fmax."}}
