{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The previous structural attempt added a branch recovery cycle, but its Fmax gain did not cover the extra cycles. The current worst path still crosses the ALU. I’m focusing on moving the combinational 32-bit products into a registered multiply unit, which could shorten that path at the cost of extra cycles only for multiply instructions."}}
