{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The previous structural changes lost fitness because their extra cycles outweighed the clock gains. The current worst path still runs through forwarding and the shared ALU into data memory. I’m investigating whether separating memory-address generation from general ALU results can shorten that path without adding pipeline latency."}}
