{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_6", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c \"rg -n 'structural|retim|redirect|register.file|operand|front.end|stage' cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl\"", "aggregated_output": "2:{\"id\": \"hyp-20261005-001-r1s0\", \"title\": \"Shared radix-4 combinational divider for RV32M\", \"category\": \"micro_opt\", \"motivation\": \"The only recorded experiment is the baseline: fitness 12.12 at median\\nFmax 5.442 MHz, with a 199.837 ns, 156-cell worst path traversing\\nforwarding and the EX-stage ALU. The ALU expresses signed and unsigned\\ndivision and remainder as separate / and % operators. These operations\\nare the strongest explanation for the exceptionally deep arithmetic path.\\nOptimizing their combinational implementation can raise Fmax without\\nadding execution cycles or changing CoreMark's memory-stall behavior.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"The only recorded experiment is the baseline: fitness 12.12 at median\\nFmax 5.442 MHz, with a 199.837 ns, 156-cell worst path traversing\\nforwarding and the EX-stage ALU. The ALU expresses signed and unsigned\\ndivision and remainder as separate / and % operators. These operations\\nare the strongest explanation for the exceptionally deep arithmetic path.\\nOptimizing their combinational implementation can raise Fmax without\\nadding execution cycles or changing CoreMark's memory-stall behavior.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Replace only the real DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU datapath with one shared, fully\\ncombinational unsigned radix-4 restoring divider. Preserve the ALU ports,\\nzero-cycle ALU latency, five-stage pipeline, forwarding, bus handshakes,\\nand nret=1 retirement contract. This is a local arithmetic-network\\noptimization, with no iterative unit, extra registers, or pipeline stalls.\\n\\nFor DIV and REM, convert each operand to its unsigned two's-complement\\nmagnitude; DIVU and REMU use the original unsigned operands. Precompute\\nzero-extended divisor multiples D, 2D, and 3D in 34 bits so overflow is\\nimpossible. Unroll sixteen stages, consuming dividend bit pairs from\\nmost significant to least significant. Each stage forms the 34-bit trial\\nremainder T = (R << 2) | next_pair and computes T-D, T-2D, and T-3D\\nin parallel as 35-bit zero-extended subtractions. Their high borrow b\n…[264480 of 267552 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:b573ef5faf911a9b]…\n\", \"description\": \"Supply live fetch PC in EX tests and verify direct/linear mismatch\\nrepair, JALR behavior, alignment traps and advance qualification.\\nInclude successor_checker.sv in the EX test's source list without\\naltering packed architectural bundle layouts or weakening checks.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 181.49, \"delta_pct\": 4.79, \"vs_baseline\": 1397.44, \"fmax_mhz\": 77.152, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4251084, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4470, \"ff\": 2361, \"seeds\": [77.209, 77.152, 77.152], \"perturbations\": [[0, 77.209, 12], [1, 77.152, 13], [2, 77.152, 13]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.wb_result_0_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_3_dmem_3_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -7.952, \"arrival_ns\": 18.246, \"logic_cells\": 12, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 12, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T03:39:39.761359Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 7}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
