{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_57","type":"agent_message","text":"Both branch variants lose too much Fmax. I’m now testing whether the complete forwarding decision can be registered with ID/EX. The current design registers address matches but still qualifies and prioritizes them in EX; moving that arbitration across the boundary could shorten both ALU and branch operand paths without changing cycle count."}}
