le ALU, rather than redesign the pipeline.\\n\\nOn a valid divide instruction, accept exactly one request when the older\\nMEM instruction is not blocking EX. Capture the fully forwarded rs1/rs2,\\noperation and instruction metadata before older forwarding sources drain.\\nHold the fetch PC and ID/EX instruction until the result can advance;\\nallow older MEM/WB i\n…[269317 of 272389 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:8a571614a7406315]…\nnce/repair. Retain all existing assertions.\\n\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_ex_stage.py\", \"description\": \"Adapt bundle helpers and verify all six exact branch comparisons,\\nprediction mismatches, repair-target equivalence, alignment faults\\nand advancement qualification; retain current execute assertions.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 212.7, \"delta_pct\": 6.42, \"vs_baseline\": 1654.95, \"fmax_mhz\": 89.967, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4229842, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3591, \"ff\": 1732, \"seeds\": [86.207, 89.967, 89.967], \"perturbations\": [[0, 86.207, 12], [1, 89.967, 11], [2, 89.967, 11]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_fwd/rs2_wb_match_q_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/pc_2_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -6.6, \"arrival_ns\": 16.894, \"logic_cells\": 17, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 12, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T06:15:18.147677Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 11}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
