ngle-cycle ALU, rather than redesign the pipeline.\\n\\nOn a valid divide instruction, accept exactly one request when the older\\nMEM instruction is not blocking EX. Capture the fully forwarded rs1/rs2,\\noperation and instruction metadata before older forwarding sources drain.\\nHold the fetch PC and ID/EX instruction until the result can advance;\\nallow older MEM/WB i\n…[327600 of 330672 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:b861e2eac847189b]…\noth taken outcomes, signed boundaries, illegal encodings, bus holds\\nand older recovery squashes. Assert exact final traps/PCs/operands/orders,\\nno wrong-path stores/DIV, unchanged cycles and exactly-once retirement.\\nRetain existing decoder, alignment and liveness coverage.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 229.77, \"delta_pct\": 2.53, \"vs_baseline\": 1795.79, \"fmax_mhz\": 101.474, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4416239, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3564, \"ff\": 1782, \"seeds\": [96.947, 101.474, 101.474], \"perturbations\": [[0, 96.947, 7], [1, 101.474, 12], [2, 101.474, 12]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.ctrl.alu_op_4_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.wb_result_16_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -5.315, \"arrival_ns\": 15.609, \"logic_cells\": 7, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_mem/u_multiplier\", \"cpu/u_mem\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 7, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T08:13:10.075590Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 14}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
